+## Provider API Base URLs
+
+Point a metadata provider at a compatible mirror or caching proxy. Each defaults to the public API, so leave them unset unless you run such a service. A trailing slash is ignored.
+
+| Name              | Notes                                          |
+| ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |
+| `TMDB_BASE_URL`   | Default to `https://api.themoviedb.org/3`.     |
+| `TVDB_BASE_URL`   | Default to `https://api4.thetvdb.com/v4`.      |
+| `TVMAZE_BASE_URL` | Default to `https://api.tvmaze.com`.           |
+
 ## Media Import
 
 See [media-imports](media-imports.md).
